{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Sabrine exits the tent, wearing her normal hat, a long purple dress, and a slightly-tattered cloak - the same clothes she had worn arriving at the City, but noticeably cleaner, and re-tailored (albeit a little clumsily) to fit her now-smaller form.\nShe's beaming, seeming to radiate light in her happiness, though her right eye is noticeably brighter than the left, which has turned a dull grey.\nA rainbow, iridescent flower grows on her staff, and another is woven into her hair, shimmering in the light as she walks towards Gil.\n\nKukudh flies behind her, wearing a flower crown and holding up the cloak like a train, basking in the attention.","created_at":"2021-08-22T14:54:55.982000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879015791352238153","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
