{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"The butterflies form a beautiful archway behind Sandigill before the spell finally dissipates.","created_at":"2021-08-22T15:08:07.961000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879019113152938014","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Gil looks up and addresses the group \"With my people, Family is the school you swim with.... a life partner is the person you grow old with.  Parents are the ones that take you in.  Every aspect of our life is choice.  Today we see two pledge to have one path through life.  Two creeks meet and become a river.  These two souls have been bound togeather since before I met them.... but today we make that official, infront you all of you... and the land itself who is here to bear witness\" as he says the land it self, all of the trees and shrubs shake, letting the leaves rustle loudly before they stop.  \"If you two wish to trade vows, this would be the time.  Otherwise I will continue\" he waits for the two of them to let him know their choice","created_at":"2021-08-22T15:12:52.713000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879020307489361940","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"ArcaniaBot","id":"810907841329627137","is_bot":1,"username":"ArcaniaBot"},"author_id":"810907841329627137","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"<@456226577798135808> Hello! Your short rest is over now! Remember to call `!game sr` to get your rechargeable abilities from Avrae.","created_at":"2021-08-22T15:13:23.637000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879020437194014760","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
