{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"Sabrine takes a deep breath.","created_at":"2021-08-22T15:14:04.452000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879020608384561213","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Roy, you've helped me through my darkest times. When I was alone and in fear, truly alone for the first time in my few months of memory, you cared for me. Even on finding out what I was, you didn't leave. And for that, I thank you. I would be honoured... to spend the rest of my life caring for you and being cared for in the same way.' a tear falls from her face.","created_at":"2021-08-22T15:17:35.537000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879021493739196437","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Sab, I came to Arcania for my home swarm, and ended up here without one. Your determination literally brought me back from the dead. We've both been looking for the path to walk, and through all that had happened, seems that we found one, and I'd like to walk it alongside you.\" Roy says his part, and then thinks to himself, \"||...it's gonna be a bit awkward if anyone here didn't know we both were dead at some point.||\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T15:22:14.148000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879022662318452736","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
